# The Boysenberry terminal is one more keystroke reader: a > for
# the "Press any key to boot" prompt, then every command typed as
# its characters plus an explicit > for the return -- without
# which the commands smear together into LEARNOOZ and PRINTCPRINTD
# until the input field overflows. The print order C D E B is the
# order the postal stickers appeared under this seed.

