# Strike any key, then east into the Switchgear Rooms. The rooms
# are numbered; subtract the previous room's number from the
# current and take the last digit of the difference: 0 east, 1
# south, 2 up, 3 north, 4 down, 5 west -- the rule the NOOZ
# message spelled out in scattered letters. The first numbered
# room allows any direction. Under this seed the rooms run 15,
# 40, 65, 88, 111, 145: east, then west, west, north, north,
# down, and the nerd asks after your sister on the way out.

