# The final door is the game's thesis in machinery: it can only be
# opened ANGRY. Relaxed, it will not move at all; each futile pull
# raises your blood pressure, and on the fifth the game declares
# "your current rage level is so great that you have the strength
# of ten" and the door gives. (The slot must be named as "reader"
# -- "slot" alone draws a disambiguation question that eats the
# next pull.)

