# The wall plug cannot be taken -- it connects where it stands.
# The DVH2 terminal is one more keystroke reader: every entry is
# its characters plus a bare > for the return. Login is the name
# from the key-card, RANDOM-Q-HACKER, password RAINBOW-TURTLE.
# TYP DVH2.HAK reads the nerd's own system file; RUN PLANE.EXE
# quietly orders the flight home.

