# One WHO draws the announcement: USER RQH ABOUT TO USE
# TRAVEL.HAK (this seed's file). The trap: DEL it, then REN
# DVH2.HAK to its name -- so when the nerd opens TRAVEL.HAK he is
# actually running his own mainframe's system file. Two more WHOs
# and the DVH2 announces AUTO SHUTDOWN: he has hacked himself,
# the plug ejects like a little rat from a tiny drainpipe, and
# the score goes up.

WHO
>
DEL
>
TRAVEL.HAK
>
REN
>
DVH2.HAK
>
TRAVEL.HAK
>
WHO
>
WHO
>
